It is a sand colored house with green shutters and a full porch.  There isa brick walkway.  If you get lost call, 735-7486 or 735-4093 and ask for Cindi or Mark.Saff**exos**To: lynneRe:   heyDate: Jan  5Well you just logged out for being netdead too long.I guess I'll catch you as soon as I can.If its important, call me at work tomorrow morning.412-635-6135, just ask for Steve.**linsolent**To: lynneSubj: Damn itDate: Feb  6I was just in the middle of writing a big reply and I lost the connection so instead of doing that again, youll just have to wait untili get ypur letter and respond to itbecause im not risking it again. OkayNice to here from u and ill be waiting on the letter.PS Do u know my address has changed:unit 4 Netanya Villas13 Chandler StreetBECLONNEN ACT 2617Ph:02 6253 0420Mobile: 0414 985 800The phone numbers are just incase u are in Australia.! hehehh**exos**To: lynneSubj: Happy Valentine's DayDate: Feb 14Happy Valentine's Day!Love,Steve**exos**To: lynneSubj: nothingDate: Feb 26K  I love youloveS**morrolan**To: lynneSubj: **smirk**Date: Feb 26well i dunno if i'll be here but i can always mail ya....and if you ever go all icky and sappy on me i swear to god i'll puke all over ya=)-mark**daniella**To: lynneRe:   yuDate: Mar  2:)my address is 3200 East Longview Ave. Apt. 35, Bloomington, IN 47408let me know how much i owe you and give me your address.  ill send you outa check if thats ok.  im good for it. *grin*that garth brooks song, when i heard it, really sort of clarified somethings for me.  i know that sounds really corny, but im trying to live it.i got the \"Sevens\" cd, its awesomekiss kissdani**exos**To: lynneSubj: HiyaDate: Mar 20Hiya hon,Whats up?I'm going out with Drew and Brian Saturday (we're going out with Carrie and hergirlfriends).My number at home changed.  Its 724-295-0086 now.Gotta run for now.Talk to you soon.Love 